(   - Rescue: If a shrinking end binds newly synthesized GTP-tubulin dimers or encounters an) Tj
T*
(   isolated GTP-island along the shaft, the GTP cap is reconstituted, halting depolymerization and) Tj
T*
(   resuming steady elongation.) Tj
