(   - At the pointed end: [G] < Cc\(-\), so net depolymerization occurs \(subunits continuously) Tj
T*
(   dissociate\).) Tj
T*
(   - At steady state, the rate of barbed-end subunit addition exactly equals the rate of) Tj
T*
(   pointed-end subunit detachment:) Tj
T*
(   k_on\(+\) * [G] - k_off\(+\) = k_off\(-\) - k_on\(-\) * [G].) Tj
T*
(   - Result: Net filament length remains invariant while individual actin monomers tread) Tj
T*
