(   synthesized in the rough ER with high-mannose N-linked glycans:) Tj
T*
(   - Step 1 \(cis-Golgi\): UDP-N-acetylglucosamine:lysosomal-enzyme) Tj
T*
(   N-acetylglucosamine-1-phosphotransferase \(GlcNAc phosphotransferase\) recognizes a specific) Tj
T*
(   three-dimensional 'signal patch' on the folded hydrolase. It transfers GlcNAc-1-phosphate from) Tj
T*
(   UDP-GlcNAc to terminal mannose residues.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 2 \(trans-Golgi\): The 'uncovering enzyme' \(phosphodiester alpha-GlcNAcase\) cleaves off) Tj
T*
