T*
(   carboxypeptidase E\) that cleave prohormones \(e.g., proinsulin to mature insulin + C-peptide\).) Tj
T*
(   Water is extruded, producing a highly concentrated dense-core secretory granule.) Tj
T*
(   - Regulated Fusion: Granules dock and prime at the plasma membrane, arrested by complexin) Tj
T*
(   clamps. Fusion occurs only when an extracellular stimulus \(e.g., glucose, action potential\)) Tj
