(   The nascent phagosome undergoes a series of hit-and-run fusion events with endocytic) Tj
T*
(   compartments:) Tj
T*
(   - Early Phagosome: Acquires Rab5, EEA1, and V-ATPase, dropping pH to ~6.0.) Tj
T*
(   - Late Phagosome: Rab conversion replaces Rab5 with Rab7, recruiting LAMP-1 and acid) Tj
T*
(   hydrolases.) Tj
T*
(   - Phagolysosome: Fuses with lysosomes. Luminal pH plummets to ~4.5. Assembly of the phagocyte) Tj
T*
(   NADPH oxidase complex \(NOX2\) produces massive bursts of superoxide radicals \(O2-\), while) Tj
T*
(   myeloperoxidase generates hypochlorous acid \(HOCl\), killing the engulfed pathogen.) Tj
